  <data name="en_pano43_description"><![CDATA[This is Riyom Rock, Located 25 kilometers from Jos along the Jos-Akwanga road is one of nature's most spectacular rock formations. This rock formation is the main identity of Plateau State as it is the most spectacular land form any one will see on entry into the state from Abuja/Akwanga road.]]></data>



  <data name="en_pano44_description"><![CDATA[The Riyom Rock is a beautiful natural tourist attraction that is laid systematically with small rocks on top. It is a pleasant architectural display of nature. It is found in Riyom Local government Area of Plateau state.]]></data>



